{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "181406",
  "name": "Marble Hotel",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "1594223"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "A stay at Marble Hotel places you in the heart of Istanbul, within a 5-minute drive of Taksim Square and Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace.  This spa hotel is 1.8 mi (2.9 km) from Galata Tower and 1.8 mi (3 km) from Egyptian Bazaar."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 89 air-conditioned rooms featuring minibars and flat-screen televisions. Your Select Comfort bed comes with Egyptian cotton sheets. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with showers feature rainfall showerheads and hair dryers."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Relax at the full-service spa, where you can enjoy massages, body treatments, and facials. Additional features at this hotel include complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a hair salon."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EIstiklal Avenue - 0.2 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Gezi Park - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Square - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galataport - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Acibadem Taksim Hospital - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bosphorus - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Vodafone Park - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pera Palace Hotel - 1.3 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Museum of Modern Art - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Congress Center - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galata Tower - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Cruise Ship Terminal - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lutfi Kirdar Convention and Exhibition Centre - 1.8 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galata Bridge - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 41.8 km / 26 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Airport (IST) - 39.7 km / 24.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Marble Hotel is Istanbul Airport (IST). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoise-free guestrooms cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EReservations are required for massage services and spa treatments. Reservations can be made by contacting the hotel prior to arrival, using the contact information on the booking confirmation. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in and contactless check-out are available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Stop by the hotel\u0027s restaurant for lunch or dinner. Dining is also available at the coffee shop/cafe, and 24-hour room service is provided. Quench your thirst with your favorite drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
